    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Summary</h2>Play as a cleaning robot, as you vacuum a variety of unique environments. Whilst listening to a relaxing soundtrack, in this fun and casual simulator.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766150/extras/e1b7f9ae032a75a5e640c8f803b799f4.poster.avif?t=1636406330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766150/extras/e1b7f9ae032a75a5e640c8f803b799f4.webm?t=1636406330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766150/extras/e1b7f9ae032a75a5e640c8f803b799f4.mp4?t=1636406330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2>'Robo Vacuum Simulator' is a relaxing game in which you immerse yourself as a cleaning robot. You will vacuum a variety of environments, including houses, hospitals, office spaces, garages, attics(who puts a cleaning robot in the attic?) and more...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Levels</h2>Vacuum rubbish in unique environments:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766150/extras/ec7d777fab903fae1275bb5ca49ca067.poster.avif?t=1636406330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766150/extras/ec7d777fab903fae1275bb5ca49ca067.webm?t=1636406330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766150/extras/ec7d777fab903fae1275bb5ca49ca067.mp4?t=1636406330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766150/extras/28c3c9cbe9858785f006b66196b2f145.poster.avif?t=1636406330\